WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:01.462
(cheerful music)

00:00:01.462 --> 00:00:04.025
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:06.262
(cheerful music)

00:00:06.262 --> 00:00:10.179
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.945
- [Man] When you thank God
for what he's giving you,

00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:20.123
you bring something
which is a perfect fruit.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:22.980
- [Announcer] This Great Big Story

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.683
is inspired by Genesis.

00:00:27.941 --> 00:00:30.691
(waves crashing)

00:00:31.954 --> 00:00:34.704
(cheerful music)

00:00:36.155 --> 00:00:40.072
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:58.060
- My name is Moshe Lazar, and
I am a rabbi in Milan, Italy.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.410
We are here to collect the etrogim

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.430
for the holiday of Sukkot.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:07.590
Sukkot is in the autumn,
when we thank his holiness

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.530
for all that he gives
us during the summer,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.530
and the etrog is a symbol
which we use for the holiday.

00:01:15.699 --> 00:01:18.449
(cheerful music)

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.900
Every fruit has its climate,

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.408
and Calabria has the climate
that the etrog needs.

00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:30.325
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:49.040
- Perfect.

00:01:50.201 --> 00:01:51.951
Very beautiful etrog.

00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:56.760
The etrog itself has
to have a minimum size.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.800
It has to be straight, not crooked.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.730
It has to be clean, not
scratched and not with marks.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.100
It has to be a perfect fruit.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.680
(cheerful music)

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.860
This is a beautiful etrog.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:14.740
Clean, nice shape, and even
has the point over here,

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.664
with we call the pitum.

00:02:16.664 --> 00:02:20.910
The United States, Australia, Argentina,

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.890
Europe, all the countries in the world

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.590
where there's a Jewish community,

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:27.048
they ask for the etrog.

00:02:27.048 --> 00:02:30.965
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:39.475 --> 00:02:42.225
(cheerful music)

00:02:45.688 --> 00:02:49.605
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.180
- Friendship and brotherhood

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.900
between different types of community,

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.560
this is something which is so important.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.950
I hope we will have
beautiful fruit this year,

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.342
and everything should be good,
everything should be well.

00:03:08.342 --> 00:03:11.092
(cheerful music)

